      "note": "The Cham sculptures here have been keeping secrets for centuries; the sandstone dancers and gods are worth a slow, cool wander."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p165",
      "kind": "meal",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Chả Bò Bà Quýt does proper street-side beef rolls — grab a stool, point at what looks good, and say ngon quá (so tasty) when the cook grins."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p258",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Dragon Bridge after dark is all fire, colour and selfie flashes — stand back a little and let the river do the posing."
    }
  ]
}
